meta {
  name: 08_Translation
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Scenario: Accept-Language changes the name returned for a package and a role

    When a package is requested with Accept-Language nb
    And the same package is requested with Accept-Language en
    And the same package is requested with Accept-Language nn
    When a role is requested across the same three languages
    And the X-Accept-Partial-Translation header is accepted

  Package and role names are seeded with real nb/en/nn translations for the
  entities used here, so the name actually changes per request. The scenario
  is read only and needs no cleanup.
}
